docs {
  # Benefit Management System

  Local collection for the FastAPI app in this repository.

  ## Getting started

  1. Start the API with `uv run dev`.
  2. Open this folder in Bruno (`Collection` → `Open Collection`).
  3. Select the `Local` environment.

  The in-memory store starts with one department (`Recursos Humanos`).
}
